                                "sense_id": "b2885703-e86e-3a58-8938-f828e4bb0285",
                                "text": "Your eager, sun-splashed face is a fresh, unscrawled sheet of theme paper, shining like magnolia petals in a youthful breeze, reflecting wholesomeness and a bright, smooth-surface joy."
